DESCRIPTION:Pat O’Neill is a stand-up comedian and weekly regular on the 
 hit comedy podcast and live show Kill Tony. Originally from Massachusetts\
 , he began his comedy career in Providence\, Rhode Island\, where he perfo
 rmed at the Comedy Connection\, including appearances as an opener for Mar
 k Normand.Now based in Austin\, Texas\, Pat has become a fixture of one of 
 the country’s most influential comedy scenes. He performs regularly at t
 he Comedy Mothership and appears weekly on Kill Tony\, where his sharp jok
 e-writing\, distinctive perspective\, and consistently strong performances
  have made him a regular on Kill Tony.With a rapidly expanding online follo
 wing and millions of views across social media platforms\, Pat continues t
 o establish himself as one of the most promising rising voices in stand-up
  comedy. He has been the closing act on Kill Tony since May 2026\, receivi
 ng rave reviews as the newest breakout star in comedy.\nMore info: https:/
 /comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/kill-tony-s-pat-oneill-30580/
